config BR2_PACKAGE_AR9311_MEDIA_TEST
	bool "AR9311 camera, decoder and HDMI playback tools"
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	help
	  Decode short H.264/HEVC clips into visible I420 frames for
	  comparison against a reference decoder on the host. Also includes
	  a bounded 1080p I420 DMA-BUF playback tool for the Gnd485 DRM driver.
	  Includes YUV420M camera-to-HEVC DMA-BUF validation.
